spans.s:
अचक्षुर्विषय a. not being within the reach of
sight, invisible;
 m. a far distance.

आचार m. conduct, (good) behaviour;
 custom, usage,
ordinance, institute;
 abl. in ˚तस्.

आचमन n. rinsing the mouth or sipping water;
 the water
used for rinsing the mouth (also f. ई).

आच॑रण n. approach, arrival;
 conduct, behaviour;
 cart,
carriage.

आचरितव्य a. to be done;
 n. impers. (it is) to be
acted in the usual way.

आचान्त a. sipped (water);
 rinsed or having rinsed (the
mouth).

आचार्य॑ m. teacher, spiritual guide (poss. ˚वन्त्;
 abstr.
˚ता† f., ˚त्व† n.);
 a cert. caste.
